      "ref": "vocabulary-health::steps.0.tip.text",
      "kind": "unit",
      "en": "아파요 = I'm sick/It hurts | 여기가 아파요 = It hurts here | 의사 선생님 = doctor | 처방전 = prescription | 보험 = insurance. Korean pharmacies (약국) are incredibly well-stocked and pharmacists are knowledgeable.",
      "shipped": "아파요 = Je suis malade/Ça fait mal | 여기가 아파요 = Ça fait mal ici | 의사 선생님 = médecin | 처방전 = ordonnance | 보험 = assurance. Les pharmacies coréennes (약국) sont incroyablement bien approvisionnées et les pharmaciens sont très compétents."
